  "prompt": "Use the uploaded user photo as the ONLY identity reference.

IDENTITY PRESERVATION IS THE HIGHEST PRIORITY.

Transform the person from the uploaded photo into the central subject of a surreal high-fashion conceptual portrait while preserving the exact same person. Keep the original gender, facial structure, face shape, eyes, nose, lips, jawline, skin tone, ethnicity, age appearance, hairstyle structure, facial hair if present, body proportions, and all recognizable identity-defining features. Do not replace the person with another face, do not beautify or redesign the identity, and do not make the subject resemble any celebrity.

SCENE:
Create a minimalist surreal interior filled with a large crowd of completely faceless human figures dressed entirely in pure white. The main subject stands exactly in the center of the composition, clearly separated from everyone else by wearing an all-black tailored outfit.

The surrounding figures must appear human in body shape but their identities are completely concealed. Every background person is covered from head to toe in seamless matte white fabric, including the entire head and face. There must be NO visible eyes, nose, mouth, skin, hair, ears, or facial features on any surrounding figure. Their heads should look like smooth anonymous human forms wrapped tightly beneath white fabric.

The crowd surrounds the main subject from the foreground through the deep background, creating a strong visual contrast: ONE recognizable individual in black among dozens of anonymous white figures.

MAIN SUBJECT:
The uploaded person is the ONLY visible recognizable face in the entire image.

Dress the subject in an elegant monochromatic black outfit:
- tailored black blazer or suit jacket
- black shirt or minimalist black top underneath
- black trousers if visible
- no bright accessories
- no logos
